        "original_id": "58f9b073-09f7-56f5-baa9-bce6cb429923",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Scientific Games Corporation\n- Products: electronic gaming machines, table games, iGaming products, iLottery products, instant lottery games, lottery gaming systems, terminals, internet applications, interactive gambling terminals, gambling control systems, scratchcards\n- Concepts: scratchcards, instant lottery\n\nFacts:\n- Scientific Games Corporation offers products including electronic gaming machines, table games, iGaming products, iLottery products, instant lottery games, lottery gaming systems, terminals and services, internet applications, server-based interactive gambling terminals, and gambling control systems.\n- A scratchcard is a small card, often made of thin paper-based card for competitions or plastic for concealed PINs, with one or more areas of hidden information that can be revealed by scratching off an opaque covering.\n- A scratchcard is also called a scratch off, scratch ticket, scratcher, scratchie, scratch-it, scratch game, scratch-and-win, instant game, or instant lottery depending on the place.",
